   "updated": 1758000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\u2022 Tools: firsthand_enroll \u00b7 attest \u00b7 deposit \u00b7 grant \u00b7 query \u00b7 rescind \u00b7 status (stdio)\n\u2022 Runs on the user's machine and may derive keys; a hostile client can only pollute its own locker (\u00a713)\n\u2022 Transport: BtxTransport (BTX_RPC_URL) | PublicMempoolTransport | memory (calldata only)\n\u2022 Buyer side via BUYER_PRIVATE_KEY + GRANTEE_SEED_HEX; PRF handoff from the PWA pending",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "box-mcp",
   "originalText": "\u2022 Tools: firsthand_enroll \u00b7 attest \u00b7 deposit \u00b7 grant \u00b7 query \u00b7 rescind \u00b7 status (stdio)\n\u2022 Runs on the user's machine and may derive keys; a hostile client can only pollute its own locker (\u00a713)\n\u2022 Transport: BtxTransport (BTX_RPC_URL) | PublicMempoolTransport | memory (calldata only)\n\u2022 Buyer side via BUYER_PRIVATE_KEY + GRANTEE_SEED_HEX; PRF handoff from the PWA pending",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
