   "seed": 2074493747,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 211907493,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1758000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\u2022 HKDF-SHA256 key tree (salt FIRSTHAND/kdf/v1): k_id \u00b7 k_ns,e \u00b7 k_dep(ns,e) \u00b7 k_nonce(ns,e) (ADR-0005)\n\u2022 P-256 authority key \u2014 verified on chain by the RIP-7212 precompile, low-s enforced\n\u2022 secp256k1 deposit keys per (ns, epoch) \u2014 sign passports and anchors, never hold funds\n\u2022 XChaCha20-Poly1305 envelope 'FH1E'; X25519 sealed-box grant wrap (ADR-0007); SecretBytes handles\n\u2022 Roadmap: guardian-threshold recovery; WebAuthn assertion parsing on chain",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "box-crypto",
   "originalText": "\u2022 HKDF-SHA256 key tree (salt FIRSTHAND/kdf/v1): k_id \u00b7 k_ns,e \u00b7 k_dep(ns,e) \u00b7 k_nonce(ns,e) (ADR-0005)\n\u2022 P-256 authority key \u2014 verified on chain by the RIP-7212 precompile, low-s enforced\n\u2022 secp256k1 deposit keys per (ns, epoch) \u2014 sign passports and anchors, never hold funds\n\u2022 XChaCha20-Poly1305 envelope 'FH1E'; X25519 sealed-box grant wrap (ADR-0007); SecretBytes handles\n\u2022 Roadmap: guardian-threshold recovery; WebAuthn assertion parsing on chain",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
