   "text": "\u2022 Logger with non-removable redaction (prf / prk / secret / privateKey / dek / seed \u2026); env loading\n\u2022 Generated ABIs for 14 contracts; golden vectors hand-derived via cast + OpenSSL, run by vitest AND forge",
