   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1758000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\u2022 enroll(x, y, epoch, nonce, sig) \u2014 principalId = keccak(x, y); P-256 verified by the precompile\n\u2022 attest(principalId, epoch, depositKeysRoot, nonce, sig) \u2014 weekly liveness; one root per epoch, monotone\n\u2022 isLive = within grace 2 \u2227 now \u2265 thawEpoch; a re-attest after a gap thaws one boundary later (\u00a77.6)\n\u2022 FROZEN is derived, never stored; nonces scoped per principal",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "box-registry",
   "originalText": "\u2022 enroll(x, y, epoch, nonce, sig) \u2014 principalId = keccak(x, y); P-256 verified by the precompile\n\u2022 attest(principalId, epoch, depositKeysRoot, nonce, sig) \u2014 weekly liveness; one root per epoch, monotone\n\u2022 isLive = within grace 2 \u2227 now \u2265 thawEpoch; a re-attest after a gap thaws one boundary later (\u00a77.6)\n\u2022 FROZEN is derived, never stored; nonces scoped per principal",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
