   "text": "\u2022 anchor(principalId, ns, epoch, batchRoot, termsHash, nonce, depositKeys[16], depositSig)\n\u2022 Deposit-key signature must recover to depositKeys[ns]; keccak(depositKeys) == attested root\n\u2022 isAnchored \u00b7 isIncluded(root, passportId, proof) \u00b7 anchorOf(root) \u2192 (principal, ns, epoch)\n\u2022 Paged = contiguous slot run per (principal, ns, epoch): the MIP-8 arm for H1 (ADR-0010)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "box-anchors",
   "originalText": "\u2022 anchor(principalId, ns, epoch, batchRoot, termsHash, nonce, depositKeys[16], depositSig)\n\u2022 Deposit-key signature must recover to depositKeys[ns]; keccak(depositKeys) == attested root\n\u2022 isAnchored \u00b7 isIncluded(root, passportId, proof) \u00b7 anchorOf(root) \u2192 (principal, ns, epoch)\n\u2022 Paged = contiguous slot run per (principal, ns, epoch): the MIP-8 arm for H1 (ADR-0010)",
   "autoResize": false,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
