   "text": "\u2022 PassportLib \u00b7 MerkleLib \u00b7 SplitMath \u00b7 AuthorityDigests \u00b7 EpochLib \u00b7 P256 \u2014 pure, fuzz-tested\n\u2022 MockUSDC: ERC-20 + EIP-3009 test double under USDC's domain (anvil only)\n\u2022 Deploy.s.sol \u2192 deployments/<chainId>.json; immutable, no admin keys",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
